  "description": {
    "text": "Yveltal Deck 30, a half deck released on 31 January 2014 together with Xerneas Deck 30, and sold early at the Jisedai World Hobby Fair '14 Winter. It holds Darkness-type Pokémon led by Yveltal, with the Trainer cards and Darkness Energy a Darkness deck needs, a player's guide and a quick guide, plus a special Collection Y booster pack: five random cards and an original holo Pancham found in no ordinary Collection Y pack. Cards from the Collection X and Collection Y expansions make it stronger."
  },
